​"Definition of a Continuation Sheet: A page is ONLY a continuation sheet if it explicitly has the words 'Continuation Sheet' printed in the top right corner. Do NOT treat standard Pages 2, 3, or 4 of the ND2A Main Form as continuation sheets. If a page is not Section 2 of the Main Form and is not a explicitly labeled Continuation Sheet, IGNORE IT and do not create a JSON entry for it."
